"Your site supports https but the store is not forcing it. Turn on so "
"checkout is always secure."
msgstr ""
"Ihre Website unterstützt https, aber der Shop erzwingt es nicht. Aktivieren "
"Sie diese Option, damit der Checkout immer sicher ist."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_setup_wizard.php:363
