#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:321
msgid "Import osCommerce data"
msgstr "osCommerce-Daten importieren"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:328
msgid ""
"Shopify discontinued the private app system this importer relied on, so "
"there is no longer a way to pull your data out of Shopify automatically. "
"Export a product CSV from Shopify and use the product importer under "
"Products instead."
msgstr ""
"Shopify hat das System privater Apps eingestellt, auf das sich dieser "
"Importer stützte, daher gibt es keine Möglichkeit mehr, Ihre Daten "
"automatisch aus Shopify zu übernehmen. Exportieren Sie stattdessen eine "
"Produkt-CSV aus Shopify und verwenden Sie den Produktimporter unter "
"„Produkte“."

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:340
msgid ""
"Analytics and ads tags, email marketing lists, affiliate tracking, Amazon S3 "
"downloads, DecoNetwork and the cart importer."
msgstr ""
"Analyse- und Anzeigen-Tags, E-Mail-Marketing-Listen, Affiliate-Tracking, "
"Amazon-S3-Downloads, DecoNetwork und der Warenkorb-Importer."

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:349
msgid "Google Analytics"
msgstr "Google Analytics"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:350
msgid ""
"GA4 ecommerce events on the storefront, plus the retired Universal Analytics "
"tag"
msgstr ""
"GA4-E-Commerce-Ereignisse im Shopfront sowie das eingestellte Universal-"
"Analytics-Tag"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:354
msgid "GA4 measurement ID"
msgstr "GA4-Measurement-ID"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:355
msgid ""
"The G-XXXXXXXXXX ID from your GA4 web data stream. Loads the Google tag on "
"store pages and sends view item, add to cart, checkout and purchase events."
msgstr ""
"Die G-XXXXXXXXXX-ID aus Ihrem GA4-Webdatenstream. Lädt das Google-Tag auf "
"Shop-Seiten und sendet die Ereignisse „Artikel ansehen“, „In den Warenkorb“, "
"„Kasse“ und „Kauf“."

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:364
msgid "Send events through Google Tag Manager"
msgstr "Ereignisse über Google Tag Manager senden"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:365
msgid ""
"Pushes the ecommerce events to the dataLayer for your Tag Manager container "
"instead of calling gtag() directly. Your container must load GA4 itself."
msgstr ""
"Sendet die E-Commerce-Ereignisse an den dataLayer für Ihren Tag-Manager-"
"Container, statt gtag() direkt aufzurufen. Ihr Container muss GA4 selbst "
"laden."

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:373
msgid "Also send events from the server"
msgstr "Ereignisse auch vom Server senden"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:374
msgid ""
"Posts view, add to cart, checkout and purchase events from your server to "
"Google through the Measurement Protocol, so they are recorded even when the "
"browser blocks tracking. Needs the three values below."
msgstr ""
"Sendet die Ereignisse „Ansehen“, „In den Warenkorb“, „Kasse“ und „Kauf“ von "
"Ihrem Server über das Measurement Protocol an Google, damit sie auch erfasst "
"werden, wenn der Browser das Tracking blockiert. Erfordert die drei "
"untenstehenden Werte."

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:383
msgid "Measurement ID for server events"
msgstr "Measurement-ID für Server-Ereignisse"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:384
msgid ""
"From the GA4 data stream. Required even when the events go through a Tag "
"Manager server container."
msgstr ""
"Aus dem GA4-Datenstream. Erforderlich, auch wenn die Ereignisse über einen "
"Tag-Manager-Servercontainer laufen."

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:395
msgid "Measurement Protocol API secret"
msgstr "Measurement-Protocol-API-Secret"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:396
msgid ""
"Create one under the data stream’s Measurement Protocol API secrets. Only "
"ever sent from your server."
msgstr ""
"Erstellen Sie eines unter den Measurement-Protocol-API-Secrets des "
"Datenstreams. Wird ausschließlich von Ihrem Server gesendet."

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:406
msgid "Server container URL"
msgstr "Servercontainer-URL"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:407
msgid ""
"Your Tag Manager server container endpoint. Server events are posted here "
"rather than straight to Google."
msgstr ""
"Der Endpunkt Ihres Tag-Manager-Servercontainers. Server-Ereignisse werden "
"hierhin statt direkt an Google gesendet."

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:418
msgid "Universal Analytics tracking ID (retired)"
msgstr "Universal-Analytics-Tracking-ID (eingestellt)"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:419
msgid ""
"Legacy UA-XXXXXXX-X property. Google stopped processing Universal Analytics "
"data in 2024; use a GA4 measurement ID instead. Leave empty to stop loading "
"the old analytics.js tag."
msgstr ""
"Veraltete UA-XXXXXXX-X-Property. Google hat die Verarbeitung von Universal-"
"Analytics-Daten 2024 eingestellt; verwenden Sie stattdessen eine GA4-"
"Measurement-ID. Leer lassen, um das Laden des alten analytics.js-Tags zu "
"beenden."

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:431
msgid "Google Ads"
msgstr "Google Ads"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:432
msgid "Conversion tracking and remarketing on the order success page"
msgstr "Conversion-Tracking und Remarketing auf der Bestellerfolgsseite"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:436
msgid "Google Ads tag ID"
msgstr "Google Ads-Tag-ID"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:437
msgid ""
"AW-XXXXXXXXX from your Google Ads account. Loads the Google tag on store "
"pages alongside GA4 so Ads conversions and remarketing audiences can be "
"measured."
msgstr ""
"AW-XXXXXXXXX aus Ihrem Google Ads-Konto. Lädt das Google-Tag auf Shop-Seiten "
"zusammen mit GA4, damit Ads-Conversions und Remarketing-Zielgruppen gemessen "
"werden können."

