msgstr "Dreistelliger Code, der mit dem Conversion-Wert übermittelt wird."

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:474
msgid "Conversion tag purpose"
msgstr "Zweck des Conversion-Tags"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:475
msgid ""
"Remarketing only records the visit for audience building without counting a "
"conversion."
msgstr ""
"Remarketing zeichnet den Besuch nur für den Aufbau von Zielgruppen auf, ohne "
"eine Conversion zu zählen."

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:478
msgid "Count conversions"
msgstr "Conversions zählen"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:479
msgid "Remarketing only"
msgstr "Nur Remarketing"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:488
msgid "Conversion language"
msgstr "Conversion-Sprache"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:489
msgid ""
"Parameter of the classic conversion.js snippet. Leave as en unless Google "
"gave you another code."
msgstr ""
"Parameter des klassischen conversion.js-Snippets. Bei „en“ belassen, sofern "
"Google Ihnen keinen anderen Code gegeben hat."

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:499
msgid "Conversion format"
msgstr "Conversion-Format"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:500
msgid ""
"Parameter of the classic conversion.js snippet. 3 shows no notification to "
"the shopper."
msgstr ""
"Parameter des klassischen conversion.js-Snippets. Bei 3 wird dem Kunden "
"keine Benachrichtigung angezeigt."

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:510
msgid "Conversion pixel color"
msgstr "Farbe des Conversion-Pixels"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:511
msgid "Six hex digits without the #, used by the classic notification formats."
msgstr ""
"Sechs Hex-Ziffern ohne #, verwendet von den klassischen "
"Benachrichtigungsformaten."

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:525
msgid ""
"Product feed for Google Shopping: download the attribute CSV, upload it, "
