#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:635
msgid "API URL"
msgstr "API-URL"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:636
msgid ""
"Your account’s API access URL, found under Settings › Developer in "
"ActiveCampaign."
msgstr ""
"Die API-Zugriffs-URL Ihres Kontos, zu finden unter „Einstellungen › "
